<title>SINGAPORE: L&amp;M unit buys remaining Envirocare shares.</title>
<headline>L&amp;M unit buys remaining Envirocare shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>L&amp;M Group Investments said on Tuesday its subsidiary L&amp;M Geotechnic Pte Ltd has acquired the remaining 20 percent shares in L&amp;M Envirocare Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>It said in a statement, L&amp;M Geotechnic Pte Ltd bought 80,000 ordinary shares for a nominal Singapore $1.00 from Mohamed Abdul Jaleel s/o Shaik Mohamed.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3080) rr jn</p>
